$( <MM> <PROOF_ASST> THEOREM=searchw  LOC_AFTER=?

* The search of the paper outputs a certified Carmichael number in ( n , n ^ ( 1 + A ) ] within the operation budget, at every tuple of scales in the window, for all large n, given AGP Theorem 3 and AGP Theorem 3.1 (Lean: search_successW_of of SearchAlg.lean).

